    "nextAction": "Formalize irreducibility via mod-3 reduction; formalize 'exactly one real root' via f' = 5x⁴-1 sign analysis; then attempt the full S₅ via Dedekind (transposition from mod-2 type (2,3)) + 5-cycle from mod-3 irreducibility.",
    "attemptCounts": {
